# Git / editors
.git
.github
.claude
.vscode
.idea
**/.DS_Store

# Deps & build output (rebuilt inside the image)
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/build
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/coverage
packages/db/generated

# Local secrets & env — compose injects these at runtime
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.local

# Logs / caches
**/*.log
**/.bun
**/npm-debug.log*
**/.eslintcache

# Compose / docs (not needed in the image)
docker-compose*.yml
README.md
*.md
